## Why This Is Asked
Assesses the ability to design a minimal yet comprehensive Azure data engineering solution that handles event-driven ingestion, schema evolution, and enterprise data governance requirements.

## Key Concepts
- Event-driven ingestion using BlobCreated triggers
- Schema drift handling and unified schema inference
- Parquet conversion for optimized storage
- Incremental loading with MERGE operations
- Azure Purview integration for lineage tracking
- Data quality validation and error handling

## Code Example
```json
{
  "name": "IngestPartnerLogs",
  "activities": [
    {
      "name": "StageRawData",
      "type": "Copy",
      "inputs": [{"name": "LandingDataset"}],
      "outputs": [{"name": "StagingDataset"}]
    },
    {
      "name": "TransformToParquet",
      "type": "DataFlow",
      "typeProperties": {
        "dataFlow": {
          "name": "PartnerLogsTransformation"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadToSilver",
      "type": "Script",
      "typeProperties": {
        "scripts": [
          "MERGE INTO Silver.PartnerLogs AS target"
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
```

## Why This Is Asked
Tests handling of mixed-format ingestion, format detection, and unifying to a common schema. Also evaluates basic Data Flow usage, incremental loads, drift tolerance, lineage, and simple quality checks.

## Key Concepts
- Azure Data Factory: format detection and routing
- Mapping Data Flows: transform CSV and Parquet into a unified schema
- Incremental loads: upserts to avoid full refreshes
- Purview lineage: tracking data from landing to Synapse
- Basic data quality: row counts, duplicates, null checks

## Code Example
```json
{
  "name": "FormatDetection",
  "type": "IfCondition",
  "conditions": [
    { "expression": "@equals(pipeline().parameters.fileType, 'CSV')" }
  ],
  "branches": {
    "CSVPath": {
      "source": {"type": "DelimitedTextSource", "delimiter": ",", "header": true},
      "sink": {"type": "SynapseSink", "table": "stg_partner_csv"}
    },
    "ParquetPath": {
      "source": {"type": "ParquetSource"},
      "sink": {"type": "SynapseSink", "table": "stg_partner_parquet"}
    }
  }
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you validate drift tolerance and automatically flag mismatches?
- What small tests would you add to verify incremental upserts and lineage accuracy?

